---
At the start of EVERY session, before doing anything else:
1. Read AGENTS.md in full
2. Confirm you understand current state in one paragraph
3. Ask what the user wants to do

At the END of every session, after completing work:
1. Update AGENTS.md — append to CHANGELOG section
2. Update any sections that changed (architecture,
   known issues, active tasks)
3. Commit AGENTS.md with message: "docs: update AGENTS.md"
4. Never leave a session without updating AGENTS.md
---
